WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.005
EVERY SENSE JING-ZHANG. A multisensory audio guide.

2
00:00:04.185 --> 00:00:07.251
This narration is computer-synthesised speech.

3
00:00:07.801 --> 00:00:12.572
The advancement of an AI city should not be defined by device count or automation rate.

4
00:00:12.752 --> 00:00:24.223
It should be tested by whether people with different bodies, senses and cognitive styles can independently understand, choose, complete and exit the same urban service.

5
00:00:24.403 --> 00:00:31.740
Universal design is therefore not a remedial layer but a shared main line for industry, space and governance.

6
00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:38.722
The baseline principle of the whole proposal is that service should be equivalent with AI on and with AI off.

7
00:00:38.902 --> 00:00:46.275
Any public-facing service should keep one equivalent completion route during outage, power loss or refusal of consent.

8
00:00:46.455 --> 00:00:54.767
Cast lettering, braille, tactile relief, fixed wayfinding and on-site staffed help do not depend on any running system.

9
00:00:54.947 --> 00:01:00.021
When the system is switched off, the information does not disappear and the task can still be completed.

10
00:01:00.201 --> 00:01:09.756
The metric for this is the AI-on/AI-off service-equivalence gap: the difference in completion rate before and after automation is disabled.

11
00:01:10.306 --> 00:01:19.606
The framework is one Universal Access Baseline, three Multisensory Labs, two support wings and ten Independent Completion Points.

12
00:01:19.786 --> 00:01:27.332
The baseline organises a continuous north-south public experience along the Jing-Zhang Railway Heritage Park.

13
00:01:27.512 --> 00:01:34.885
It offers a direct multimodal route and a lower-stimulation alternative route for people sensitive to sound and light.

14
00:01:35.435 --> 00:01:38.244
The three key areas each carry their own role.

15
00:01:38.424 --> 00:01:45.796
Zhongzhiyuan takes validation, publishing the test status of universal interfaces, the human-handover points and the failed samples.

16
00:01:45.977 --> 00:01:53.697
The Beijing AI Origin Community takes co-design, with residents and users testing whether services work in everyday life.

17
00:01:53.877 --> 00:02:01.551
Dazhongsi takes adoption, testing procurement, maintenance, correction and exit, and keeping cash and staffed alternatives.

18
00:02:01.731 --> 00:02:14.444
The Zhongguancun Technology Service Wing brings in technology, talent, capital and professional services; the Xiaoyuehe Scenario Empowerment Wing provides open settings and real feedback.

19
00:02:14.994 --> 00:02:25.095
The ten Independent Completion Points turn abstract scenario descriptions into public interfaces that are recognisable, inhabitable, testable and exitable.

20
00:02:25.275 --> 00:02:39.265
They are evaluation instruments at the same time: independent completion, two-channel information redundancy and the AI-on/AI-off service-equivalence gap are measured repeatedly at these points.

21
00:02:39.445 --> 00:02:43.915
There is no site baseline at this stage, so every value is marked to be measured.

22
00:02:44.465 --> 00:02:47.275
This proposal is a conceptual recommendation.

23
00:02:47.455 --> 00:02:54.061
Boundaries in the drawings are not official redlines, and areas are not statutory or surveyed figures.

24
00:02:54.241 --> 00:03:03.192
The spatial actions constitute no regulatory detailed plan, engineering design or approval conclusion, and represent no existing arrangement.

25
00:03:03.372 --> 00:03:10.582
This narration is synthesised by system speech, with no human recording, no sampled music and no field audio.

26
00:03:11.132 --> 00:03:14.150
One city. Many ways to sense it.
